1. {d}en-lil₂ gu#-[ti-um]{[ki]} muš-ŋiri₂ hur-saŋ-[ŋa₂]
#lem: Enlil[1]DN; Gutium[1]GN; mušŋiri[fanged snake]; hursaŋ[mountain]
#tr.en: @wDN{Enlil}, the king of all the lands, 
#etcsl: line-id=1

2. lu₂ a₂ zig₃!(NAM)-ga diŋir-re-e-ne#
#lem: lu[person]; a[arm]; zig[rise]; diŋir[deity]
#tr.en: entrusted @wRN{@wDN{Utu}-ḫeŋal}, the mighty man, 
#etcsl: line-id=2

3. lu₂ nam-lugal ki-en-gi-ra₂ kur-še₃ ba-de₆-a
#lem: lu[person]; namlugal[kingship]; Kengir[1]; kur[mountain(s)]; de[carry]
#tr.en: the king of @wSN{Unug}, 
