15. {d}en-lil₂-le nam-lugal ki-en-gi-ra šu#-ba gi₄-gi₄-de₃
#lem: Enlil[1]DN; namlugal[kingship]; Kengir[1]; šu[hand]; gi[turn]
#tr.en: lioness in the battle, who butts the foreign lands, 
#etcsl: line-id=15

16. a₂#-[bi mu-da-an-aŋ₂] a₂#-[tah-ŋu₁₀ he₂-me-en]
#lem: a[arm]; aŋ[measure]; atah[helper]; me[be]
#tr.en: @wDN{Enlil} has entrusted me with bringing back the kingship to @wGN{Sumer}. May you be my help!”} 
#etcsl: line-id=16

